#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"W_{h_i} = |c_i| / \\lambda\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"W_{h_i} = |c_i| / \\lambda\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Fermionic and hardware-native optimizations**\n"
msgstr "**Otimizações fermiônicas e nativas de hardware**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The function `generate_preset_jw_pass_manager()` returns a `MultiStagePassManager` that takes a `FermionicCircuit` and produces an optimized final circuit that we can transpile to run on our hardware. We replace its default optimization stage with a `FermionicPassManager` containing our `QDriftTrotterization` pass:\n"
msgstr "A função `generate_preset_jw_pass_manager()` retorna um `MultiStagePassManager` que recebe um `FermionicCircuit` e produz um circuito final otimizado que podemos transpilar para executar em nosso hardware. Substituímos seu estágio de otimização padrão por um `FermionicPassManager` contendo nosso passe `QDriftTrotterization`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `QDriftTrotterization` pass uses the weight-calculation and sampling internally to generate the circuits that we will use for sampling\n"
